{"version":1,"content":"<p>楊千嬅、衛蘭、AGA江海迦及岑寧兒（Yoyo），將於12月12日齊集澳門威尼斯人綜藝館，參與為領賢慈善基金《The EverPresent LIVE》籌款的慈善音樂會，聯同50位香港青少年管弦樂團樂手，將歌曲重新編成管弦樂版本，帶來別開生面的音樂合作。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T05:38:33.554719+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T04:45:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:15.088618+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T05:38:33.554719+00:00","content_hash":"3c6c70a5c317d41d78d885587df27c6d98650d786c0e09fdae3c80a6b6930fcd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}